 ## Background
-The Visual Complexity algorithm was introduced by [Engaging viewers through nonphotorealistic visualizations](https://doi.org/10.1145/1274871.1274886) [S1]. It is part of a family of volume illustration techniques that use painting metaphors to visualize data. The method draws inspiration from psychological studies on aesthetics and complexity, aiming to enhance viewer engagement through local visual variations rather than global trends.
+The Visual Complexity algorithm was introduced by [Engaging viewers through nonphotorealistic visualizations](https://doi.org/10.1145/1274871.1274886) [S1]. It is part of a family of volume illustration techniques that use painting metaphors to visualize data. The method draws inspiration from psychological studies on aesthetics and complexity, aiming to enhance viewer engagement through local visual variations rather than global trends [S1].
 
